              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyike tebulo kunja kwa katani yotchinga cha kumpoto kwa chihema ndipo uyike choyikapo nyale chija kummwera moyangʼanana ndi tebulolo.",
          "type": "text",
